        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Brown the chicken skin-side down in a hot pan and do not move it. A good sear locks in moisture and gives the sauce its depth. The skin can be removed after searing if you prefer."
          }
        ]
